WEBVTT

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:08.540
Memories of my Mom

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:08.540
Howl, MachGaogamon

00:00:05.470 --> 00:00:06.830
Memories of my Mom!

00:00:06.830 --> 00:00:08.540
Howl, MachGaogamon!

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:15.110
In order to defeat Mercurimon, Masaru and co. Dived into the Digital World.

00:00:15.110 --> 00:00:18.410
Falling under the attacks of the awaiting Ikuto and Falcomon,

00:00:18.410 --> 00:00:21.530
and unable to obtain backup from DATS,

00:00:21.530 --> 00:00:28.200
Masaru and the others headed to Infinity Ice Ridge, where they were told Mercurimon and a Digital Gate were located.

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:36.360
Hey, Aniki... are we there yet?

00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:37.520
You can say that again.

00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:41.330
How much farther do we have to walk until we reach that Infinity-what's-it-called?

00:00:41.330 --> 00:00:42.580
Stop complaining.

00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:46.680
We have no other choice. We can't return to the human world

00:00:46.680 --> 00:00:49.340
until we reach the Digital Gate in Infinity Ice Ridge.

00:00:49.340 --> 00:00:50.330
That's wrong!

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:55.130
We're not going there to return to the human world.

00:00:55.130 --> 00:00:59.020
We're going there to beat Mercurimon and that snotty little punk!

00:00:59.020 --> 00:00:59.340
Yeah!

00:01:00.780 --> 00:01:01.700
That's true.

00:01:01.700 --> 00:01:02.560
Master.

00:01:03.100 --> 00:01:04.740
What's wrong, Gaomon?

00:01:04.740 --> 00:01:05.520
Look.

00:01:06.220 --> 00:01:07.180
Is it a valley?

00:01:07.180 --> 00:01:08.070
Yes.

00:01:08.070 --> 00:01:09.480
It looks quite large.

00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:12.670
What is this?

00:01:12.670 --> 00:01:16.510
They're buildings built above ground... right?

00:01:17.190 --> 00:01:18.220
But...

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:21.950
Why are they sideways?

00:01:21.950 --> 00:01:24.370
The buildings and houses are protruding from the cliff...

00:01:24.940 --> 00:01:26.730
This is the Digital World.

00:01:26.730 --> 00:01:28.540
Anything is possible.

00:01:29.070 --> 00:01:30.080
Freaky.

00:01:30.240 --> 00:01:32.710
Do we really have to go through here?

00:01:32.710 --> 00:01:34.160
It looks sort of ominous...

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:36.200
There's no time for pointless talk!

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:38.580
We've got no other way to get through, right?

00:01:38.580 --> 00:01:40.180
Then we'll just have to go right in!

00:01:40.180 --> 00:01:41.330
Masaru, wait!

00:01:41.330 --> 00:01:42.010
I'm coming, too!

00:01:52.210 --> 00:01:53.320
It's fine, come on down!

00:02:01.400 --> 00:02:03.640
You should cut the rope <i>after</i>  everyone is down!

00:02:03.640 --> 00:02:04.700
Sorry, sorry!

00:02:05.260 --> 00:02:08.110
Whatever, just get off of me!

00:02:08.110 --> 00:02:11.170
Hey, do you think we can cross over to the other side from over there?

00:02:11.730 --> 00:02:14.040
Let's go down a little farther first and look for a route.

00:02:17.250 --> 00:02:19.190
What are you doing? Let's go, Gaomon.

00:02:19.190 --> 00:02:20.490
Yes, Master!

00:02:22.800 --> 00:02:30.350
Kuramon

00:02:22.800 --> 00:02:30.350
Baby Level

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:24.790
Kuramon.

00:02:24.790 --> 00:02:26.470
A Baby Level Digimon.

00:02:26.470 --> 00:02:30.350
It propagates like bacteria within computer networks.

00:02:37.250 --> 00:02:39.560
Humans... won't forgive!

00:02:39.560 --> 00:02:40.930
Ikuto...

00:02:42.400 --> 00:02:43.320
Interesting...

00:02:43.320 --> 00:02:45.780
They've gone into an interesting place.

00:02:45.780 --> 00:02:47.080
Gotsumon?

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:49.370
That'll be the last place they ever go.

00:02:49.370 --> 00:02:52.510
No one has ever left that valley unharmed.

00:03:03.350 --> 00:03:04.620
What's wrong?

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:06.060
Master, something's here!

00:03:07.660 --> 00:03:09.100
They're finally showing themselves!

00:03:22.010 --> 00:03:23.030
What the hell are these?!

00:03:24.700 --> 00:03:33.620
Dokugumon

00:03:24.700 --> 00:03:33.620
Adult Level

00:03:25.570 --> 00:03:26.660
Dokugumon.

00:03:26.660 --> 00:03:30.430
An Adult Level Digimon with a computer virus running through its body.

00:03:30.430 --> 00:03:33.620
It waits for its prey to fall asleep before it kills them with its deadly poisonous fangs.

00:03:35.140 --> 00:03:36.000
Dodge!

00:03:38.780 --> 00:03:39.640
Lalamon!

00:03:44.600 --> 00:03:46.050
There's too many of them!

00:03:46.050 --> 00:03:47.680
Don't get caught or you're finished!

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:51.840
Yoshino-san!

00:03:51.840 --> 00:03:53.060
Agumon!

00:03:54.590 --> 00:03:55.450
Damn it...

00:03:55.450 --> 00:03:56.380
Master!

00:03:58.570 --> 00:03:59.330
Damn!

00:04:01.700 --> 00:04:02.570
M-Master!

00:04:03.010 --> 00:04:05.270
Damn it, let go!

00:05:12.440 --> 00:05:13.620
Damn...

00:05:13.620 --> 00:05:14.850
I can't get out!

00:05:14.850 --> 00:05:17.020
Damn it! What are you planning to do to us?!

00:05:17.200 --> 00:05:19.000
Yoshino, are you okay?

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:19.900
Yeah, thanks!

00:05:19.900 --> 00:05:20.920
How about you guys?

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:22.530
We're fine!

00:05:22.530 --> 00:05:23.480
We're okay!

00:05:24.420 --> 00:05:26.390
What are they plotting?

00:05:26.390 --> 00:05:28.900
They've separated the humans and the Digimon...

00:05:29.480 --> 00:05:30.450
What's that?

00:05:30.860 --> 00:05:33.330
It's coming from down there.

00:05:33.770 --> 00:05:35.620
Damn humans...

00:05:36.940 --> 00:05:38.790
You human filth should be cursed.

00:05:39.210 --> 00:05:40.130
Who's that?

00:05:40.450 --> 00:05:41.880
Sleep...

00:05:41.880 --> 00:05:45.870
and roam aimlessly in your nightmares!

00:05:45.870 --> 00:05:46.380
What?

00:05:47.020 --> 00:05:49.250
Your hearts...

00:05:49.250 --> 00:05:51.850
will be mine for the taking.

00:05:53.490 --> 00:05:54.310
What's that?

00:05:55.010 --> 00:05:56.010
What?

00:05:56.010 --> 00:05:58.270
I'm getting... kind of sleep-...

00:06:03.330 --> 00:06:06.040
What are you doing, Aniki?! This isn't the time to be sleeping!

00:06:06.040 --> 00:06:06.870
That's not it!

00:06:06.870 --> 00:06:08.860
This noise made them fall asleep!

00:06:09.210 --> 00:06:10.480
This is bad.

00:06:10.480 --> 00:06:12.140
What's bad?

00:06:12.140 --> 00:06:13.410
That's...

00:06:13.820 --> 00:06:15.250
MetalPhantomon.

00:06:28.800 --> 00:06:38.600
MetalPhantomon

00:06:28.800 --> 00:06:38.600
Perfect Level

00:06:29.500 --> 00:06:30.900
MetalPhantomon.

00:06:30.900 --> 00:06:34.240
A Perfect Level Digimon with a scythe that can contain energy.

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:38.600
He reaps others' souls with his bizarre cry, Grave Scream.

00:06:39.270 --> 00:06:42.240
So that's the ruler of the valley, MetalPhantomon.

00:06:42.240 --> 00:06:43.000
Yes.

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:46.820
He's a fearsome Digimon who feasts upon the souls of living beings.

00:06:47.850 --> 00:06:52.300
MetalPhantomon puts to sleep all of the intruders that his minions, the Dokugumon, offer him,

00:06:52.300 --> 00:06:57.790
showing them a nightmare of bottomless despair as he sucks away the vitality of their hearts.

00:06:58.410 --> 00:07:01.220
If MetalPhantomon steals your heart, you're done for.

00:07:01.220 --> 00:07:04.070
You won't even be considered alive anymore.

00:07:04.070 --> 00:07:05.670
What a frightening guy!

00:07:07.490 --> 00:07:09.840
Wander about, little humans.

00:07:21.380 --> 00:07:23.370
All we have to do is watch from here,

00:07:23.370 --> 00:07:25.670
and those humans will be obliterated for us!

00:07:30.170 --> 00:07:32.150
What do we do?!

00:07:32.910 --> 00:07:36.960
We have to come up with something before MetalPhantomon sucks out their souls completely.

00:07:39.040 --> 00:07:40.340
Damn it!

00:07:40.340 --> 00:07:41.500
Aniki!

00:07:41.500 --> 00:07:43.890
Wake up!

00:07:45.870 --> 00:07:48.420
Masaru-niichan!

00:07:48.420 --> 00:07:51.340
Help me, Masaru-niichan!

00:07:51.820 --> 00:07:53.840
Chika! I'll be right there!

00:07:55.910 --> 00:07:57.430
Don't get in my way!

00:07:59.190 --> 00:07:59.900
What?

00:08:01.550 --> 00:08:03.190
What are these things?!

00:08:03.190 --> 00:08:04.140
Damn it!

00:08:04.140 --> 00:08:05.150
You!

00:08:06.030 --> 00:08:06.880
Little...!

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:07.690
Damn it!

00:08:08.040 --> 00:08:10.210
Masaru-niichan!

00:08:11.020 --> 00:08:12.140
Chika!

00:08:14.480 --> 00:08:17.530
Masaru-niichan!

00:08:17.530 --> 00:08:19.280
Chika!

00:08:20.930 --> 00:08:22.250
Chika...!

00:08:22.610 --> 00:08:23.950
Aniki!

00:08:23.950 --> 00:08:25.210
It's no use.

00:08:25.870 --> 00:08:29.460
Your voices will no longer reach the humans.

00:08:29.460 --> 00:08:33.490
They've already become possessed by their own nightmares.

00:08:33.490 --> 00:08:34.590
No way...

00:08:34.590 --> 00:08:35.640
Yoshino!

00:08:39.690 --> 00:08:41.350
Th-This is...

00:08:43.900 --> 00:08:44.990
That's...

00:08:46.350 --> 00:08:48.120
That's me when I was a kid!

00:08:48.120 --> 00:08:49.570
Don't come near me!

00:08:50.810 --> 00:08:52.890
I hate Mom and Dad...

00:08:52.890 --> 00:08:54.150
I hate everyone!

00:08:55.570 --> 00:08:56.990
What is this...?

00:08:58.200 --> 00:08:59.950
Please, stop!

00:09:03.840 --> 00:09:05.120
Yoshino!

00:09:05.550 --> 00:09:07.170
Everyone, wake up!

00:09:09.720 --> 00:09:13.840
These humans are now wandering deep within their own hearts.

00:09:13.840 --> 00:09:16.030
What they're scared of...

00:09:16.030 --> 00:09:17.800
What they don't want to see...

00:09:17.800 --> 00:09:20.120
What they want to forget...

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:21.760
What they want to run away from...

00:09:21.760 --> 00:09:26.900
What they don't want to remember... They are seized within all of that.

00:09:26.900 --> 00:09:28.730
They will never return to you now!

00:09:29.890 --> 00:09:31.040
Master...

00:09:37.140 --> 00:09:38.360
Where...?

00:09:39.200 --> 00:09:40.670
Where...

00:09:40.670 --> 00:09:41.710
...am I?

00:09:42.930 --> 00:09:44.370
This is...

00:09:44.370 --> 00:09:46.290
This is... my hometown!

00:09:49.900 --> 00:09:52.120
There's no mistake. This is...

00:09:57.130 --> 00:10:00.040
This is the town where I grew up!

00:10:13.260 --> 00:10:14.250
Mom...

00:10:22.520 --> 00:10:23.910
Everything is so familiar...

00:10:24.840 --> 00:10:26.870
The place where I was born...

00:10:28.370 --> 00:10:30.840
The place where I lived with Mom...

00:10:33.050 --> 00:10:34.130
Mom...

00:10:49.360 --> 00:10:51.020
Why?!

00:10:53.750 --> 00:10:55.270
Hey, hey, look.

00:10:55.270 --> 00:10:57.710
He bought this for me today, doesn't it look cute?

00:10:57.710 --> 00:10:59.460
No way! It's super-cute!

00:10:59.460 --> 00:11:00.540
I wish I had one!

00:11:03.240 --> 00:11:04.120
It can't be...

00:11:06.820 --> 00:11:07.830
This is...!

00:11:09.300 --> 00:11:10.420
Mom!

00:11:10.420 --> 00:11:12.080
There's a summer festival today!

00:11:12.080 --> 00:11:13.000
Let's go!

00:11:14.990 --> 00:11:16.190
Let's see...

00:11:18.440 --> 00:11:20.520
Okay! Let's go!

00:11:20.520 --> 00:11:21.420
All right!

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:26.450
I can still...

00:11:26.450 --> 00:11:28.070
I can still make it!

00:11:28.070 --> 00:11:29.600
That's right.

00:11:29.600 --> 00:11:33.480
Today is the day you lost your precious mother.

00:11:35.490 --> 00:11:37.940
You think if you run, you'll make it in time?

00:11:38.540 --> 00:11:40.900
Run, then! Hurry away!

00:11:41.430 --> 00:11:42.260
Mom...

00:11:42.540 --> 00:11:43.470
Mom!

00:11:43.610 --> 00:11:44.520
Mom!

00:11:47.430 --> 00:11:48.260
Master!

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:51.440
This...

00:11:51.440 --> 00:11:52.190
This thing...

00:11:52.190 --> 00:11:53.370
Get it off!!

00:11:53.760 --> 00:11:58.580
Is sitting here and watching them the only thing we can do?

00:11:58.580 --> 00:12:00.340
We must believe.

00:12:00.340 --> 00:12:03.590
We must believe in the strength of their hearts.

00:12:04.860 --> 00:12:05.900
Master...

00:12:11.570 --> 00:12:13.160
This is it.

00:12:13.160 --> 00:12:14.490
My house...

00:12:25.560 --> 00:12:26.410
Mom!

00:12:28.710 --> 00:12:30.400
Mom! Mom!

00:12:30.400 --> 00:12:33.300
Open up! Please listen to me!

00:12:33.300 --> 00:12:35.450
This is about what'll happen to you!

00:12:35.450 --> 00:12:36.560
Please!

00:12:36.560 --> 00:12:38.560
Please open up!

00:12:38.560 --> 00:12:40.150
Please, Mom!

00:12:40.150 --> 00:12:41.970
Listen to me!!

00:12:43.930 --> 00:12:44.860
Mom!

00:12:46.460 --> 00:12:48.190
That's... me...

00:12:48.190 --> 00:12:50.660
Mom, I'll be waiting outside!

00:12:52.230 --> 00:12:55.410
I'm so excited! I wish I was there right now!

00:12:55.410 --> 00:12:57.710
Hey, come on, Mom!

00:12:57.710 --> 00:13:00.570
If we don't hurry up, the festival will be over!

00:13:00.570 --> 00:13:02.880
Yes, yes. I'll be right there.

00:13:03.910 --> 00:13:06.170
There's no need to rush.

00:13:06.170 --> 00:13:08.220
Hurry up!

00:13:08.220 --> 00:13:09.890
Don't worry, we'll get there in time.

00:13:13.100 --> 00:13:13.910
Mom...

00:13:14.550 --> 00:13:15.600
Sorry for the wait.

00:13:15.600 --> 00:13:16.800
Now, let's get going.

00:13:16.800 --> 00:13:17.450
Yeah!

00:13:18.830 --> 00:13:20.390
Mom! Don't go!

00:13:23.160 --> 00:13:24.460
Wh...at...?

00:13:26.950 --> 00:13:27.880
What was that?

00:13:27.880 --> 00:13:29.350
Let's go, Mom!

00:13:29.350 --> 00:13:30.030
Yes!

00:13:36.980 --> 00:13:38.140
What'll you do?

00:13:38.140 --> 00:13:41.410
If you let things go on like this, your mother will die.

00:13:43.470 --> 00:13:44.110
Wait!

00:13:45.640 --> 00:13:46.790
Mom!

00:13:46.790 --> 00:13:48.460
Mom, please wait!

00:13:48.460 --> 00:13:49.370
Please!

00:13:49.370 --> 00:13:51.230
I'm begging you!

00:13:51.230 --> 00:13:53.310
Don't go to the festival!

00:13:53.310 --> 00:13:54.720
Please wait!

00:13:55.600 --> 00:13:58.130
Mom, listen to me!

00:13:58.130 --> 00:13:59.070
Stop!

00:13:59.070 --> 00:14:00.250
Mom!!

00:14:03.720 --> 00:14:04.440
Master!

00:14:05.110 --> 00:14:07.740
The light that's surrounding Tohma is getting stronger!

00:14:07.740 --> 00:14:08.910
Damn it!

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:10.210
Hey, stop this!

00:14:10.210 --> 00:14:11.410
I'll take you on instead!

00:14:11.410 --> 00:14:13.310
Stop this, you bastard!

00:14:13.960 --> 00:14:14.930
Master!

00:14:14.930 --> 00:14:16.980
Hang in there, Master!

00:14:17.320 --> 00:14:18.440
Master!!

00:14:20.950 --> 00:14:21.730
Don't!

00:14:21.730 --> 00:14:22.950
Stop!

00:14:22.950 --> 00:14:24.790
Please stop, Mom!

00:14:24.790 --> 00:14:26.570
Don't go any farther!

00:14:26.570 --> 00:14:27.820
Please stop!

00:14:28.060 --> 00:14:30.170
Mom, please stop!

00:14:30.170 --> 00:14:31.200
Mom!!

00:14:41.130 --> 00:14:43.330
Stop! There are people here!

00:14:43.740 --> 00:14:45.050
Stop!!

00:14:48.660 --> 00:14:53.030
Please stop!!

00:15:22.680 --> 00:15:24.530
This is the end.

00:15:24.530 --> 00:15:27.430
Lock yourself in the sorrow of your heart

00:15:27.430 --> 00:15:31.460
and drift eternally in this nightmare.

00:15:32.310 --> 00:15:34.280
Your memories...

00:15:34.280 --> 00:15:36.050
and your grief...

00:15:36.050 --> 00:15:39.020
I'll take all of it as my nourishment!

00:15:41.700 --> 00:15:42.720
Tohma!

00:15:42.720 --> 00:15:43.560
Master!

00:16:12.860 --> 00:16:13.760
What?

00:16:14.310 --> 00:16:15.470
Master!!

00:16:30.980 --> 00:16:31.900
Mom.

00:16:33.250 --> 00:16:35.580
It's all right, Mom.

00:16:35.580 --> 00:16:39.140
You'll always stay alive within my memories.

00:16:39.140 --> 00:16:44.020
Not just the painful memories, but the enjoyable ones as well.

00:16:55.440 --> 00:16:56.450
Master!!

00:16:58.090 --> 00:17:02.180
The one who showed me hurtful memories of my mom...

00:17:02.180 --> 00:17:05.240
is you, MetalPhantomon!

00:17:06.370 --> 00:17:10.370
Using the memories of my mom to try to attain my heart...

00:17:10.370 --> 00:17:12.050
is absolutely unforgivable!

00:17:13.010 --> 00:17:17.490
Accept retribution for toying with a person's soul!

00:17:17.990 --> 00:17:20.290
That light... it can't be...!

00:17:20.290 --> 00:17:21.460
Let's go, Gaomon!

00:17:23.010 --> 00:17:24.060
Digisoul...

00:17:28.460 --> 00:17:30.140
Full Charge!

00:17:34.160 --> 00:17:35.380
Gaomon, evolve!

00:17:57.230 --> 00:17:58.400
MachGaogamon!

00:18:01.990 --> 00:18:11.830
MachGaogamon

00:18:01.990 --> 00:18:11.830
Perfect Level

00:18:03.050 --> 00:18:04.590
MachGaogamon.

00:18:04.590 --> 00:18:08.600
A Perfect Level Digimon with enormous propulsive force, who carries rocket engines on his back.

00:18:08.600 --> 00:18:11.830
His special attacks are Winning Knuckle and Howling Cannon!

00:18:12.920 --> 00:18:15.250
Hate to say it, but he looks cool!

00:18:15.250 --> 00:18:17.550
Gaomon evolved to Perfect Level!

00:18:17.990 --> 00:18:19.590
Howling Cannon!

00:18:26.400 --> 00:18:27.050
Huh?

00:18:27.050 --> 00:18:29.240
Aniki, let's go!

00:18:29.240 --> 00:18:31.100
This is no time to be drowsy!

00:18:31.600 --> 00:18:33.110
Those guys...

00:18:33.110 --> 00:18:34.010
The curse...

00:18:34.010 --> 00:18:36.110
They were able to break the curse?!

00:18:37.630 --> 00:18:39.650
I won't fall for the same trick twice!

00:18:46.940 --> 00:18:49.490
Digisoul Charge!

00:18:54.220 --> 00:18:55.830
Agumon, evolve!

00:18:59.850 --> 00:19:01.140
GeoGreymon!

00:19:00.130 --> 00:19:05.620
<b>mou nani mo nai sekai ja kandou dekinai</b>

00:19:00.130 --> 00:19:05.620
<b>A world that's full of nothing can't inspire anyone</b>

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:10.580
<b>sou, kizuita sono hi kara wakaru no sa</b>

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:10.580
